       "text": "on \"a restart needs both\" \u2014 response count and who wrote last pin a responses file to its record, nothing else gets compared. and a first write has nothing to compare against at all, so what the ledger carries there is created, never verified \u2014 verified is only what a load returns when both of those matched.",
