        "adapted": "one of those killed runs left half a json line and resume died in json.loads. we dont discard an intact log over that, adopt it and carry on.",
        "choice": "page|engineering/ws-050-batch-mode-50-cost-async-batch-apis.md|comment|nils",
        "anchor": "Worth noting on the resume path: I went back through the batch tickets from the last two months",
        "candidates": [
         "page|incidents/postmortem-v0-1-23-post1-hotfix.md|comment|nils",
         "page|meetings/weekly-notes-week-of-may-5.md|comment|nils",
