          "carried_by": "dermot 15:10"
         },
         {
          "piece": ".log_responses and .log_last_author are also attributes on the exception",
          "carried_by": "nikolai 14:05"
         },
         {
          "piece": "Those two attributes carry the log side only, deliberately, with values 2 and 'client'",
          "carried_by": "nikolai 16:15"
         },
         {
          "piece": "Both sides showing 'client' is the normal shape of a tail-truncated ledger, not corruption",
          "carried_by": "dario 15:40"
         }
        ]
       },
