       "uncarried": [],
       "repaired_from": "TurnLedgerDesyncError on resume, message verbatim: /work/agent/turn_ledger.json records 1 response(s) last authored by 'client', the log holds 2 last authored by 'client'. .log_responses and .log_last_author sit on it too.",
       "repair_note": "The old wording gave the error and both sides of it but never said what raised it, so the comparison read as something read_sidecar or TurnLedger.load did on its own. Naming the frame the traceback bottoms out in makes the desync check a named callable, while still leaving open what it takes and what it returns when nothing disagrees."
